{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "EZK",
 "chapter": 27,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.3",
   "range": "EZK.27.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0c73e527",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.3#p1-0c73e527",
     "text": "Which serves all the world with your merchandise.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "of the people for many isles"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.5",
   "range": "EZK.27.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c5f77003",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.5#p1-c5f77003",
     "text": "This mountain was called Hermon but the Amorites called it Shenir, De 3:9.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "Senir",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "De 3:9",
       "ref": "DEU.3.9"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.6",
   "range": "EZK.27.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e09492e9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.6#p1-e09492e9",
     "text": "Which is taken for Greece and Italy.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "Chittim"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.9",
   "range": "EZK.27.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1cb5f2fd",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.9#p1-1cb5f2fd",
     "text": "Meaning, that they built the walls of the city, which is here meant by the ship: and of these were the builders of Solomon's temple, 1Ki 5:18.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "calkers",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 5:18",
       "ref": "1KI.5.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.11",
   "range": "EZK.27.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b082da2f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.11#p1-b082da2f",
     "text": "That is they of Cappadocia, or pygmies and dwarfs which were called because from the high towers they seemed little.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "Gammadims were in thy towers"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.13",
   "range": "EZK.27.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "59ed7262",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.13#p1-6458aba1",
     "text": "Of Greece, Italy and Cappadocia.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "Javan"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.13#p2-05f8bb36",
     "text": "By selling slaves.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "in the persons of men and"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.14",
   "range": "EZK.27.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4b3ee8a9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.14#p1-4b3ee8a9",
     "text": "Which are taken for a people of Asia minor.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "Togarmah traded in thy fairs with"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.15",
   "range": "EZK.27.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "984a6b1c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.15#p1-984a6b1c",
     "text": "Meaning, unicorn's horns and elephant's teeth.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "horns of ivory and ebony"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.17",
   "range": "EZK.27.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "873ca513",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.17#p1-873ca513",
     "text": "Where the best wheat grew.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "Minnith"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.26",
   "range": "EZK.27.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c17862a2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.26#p1-c17862a2",
     "text": "That is, Nebuchadnezzar.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "east wind hath broken thee in"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.28",
   "range": "EZK.27.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "07c81132",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.28#p1-07c81132",
     "text": "That is, the cities near you, as Zidon, Arund and others.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "common lands shall shake at the"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZK.27.36",
   "range": "EZK.27.36",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a5d2a3a4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZK.27.36#p1-a5d2a3a4",
     "text": "By which is meant a long time: for it was prophesied to be destroyed but seventy years, Isa 23:15.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "any more",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Isa 23:15",
       "ref": "ISA.23.15"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
